<title>USA: Cascade sets special dividend.</title>
<headline>Cascade sets special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cascade Corp said its board declared a special year-end dividend of nine cents per share in addition to the regular quarterly dividend of nine cents per share.  Both dividends are payable March 14, 1997 to shareholders of record February 21, 1997.</p>
<p>The company also said favorable operating results indicate that sales and earnings for the fiscal year ended January 31, 1996 were in line with analysts' expectations, which range from $1.47 to $1.50 per share.</p>
</text>
